# November 19, 2026: Allegany County, New York (Angelica, Belmont, Belfast, Caneadea, Alfred, Wellsville, Cuba, Bolivar,
# Petrolia, Rushford, Centerville). Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (wny); the Atlas had no place
